Avery: Someone needs to tighten the empty-state copy. Not sure who owns content this week.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:27.000
Jordan: Let's just say it should be done by Friday. Whoever grabs it, grab it.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Riley: I can look at the ranking weights next week, but I don't want to commit to a ship date.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:46.000
