00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Jordan: Riley, can you at least send a short note to support by tomorrow with what we know?

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Riley: Yes — I'll send the support note by tomorrow.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Avery: And somebody — really anybody — needs to book a follow-up review next week.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Jordan: Fine. We'll treat booking that review as unassigned for now.
